# Track: proposals + rules (docs/), the two final datasets, and encoding results.
# Everything else stays local: scripts/, raw ASD/AlloBench dumps, PDB cache.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md

# docs/ — proposals (.tex/.pdf) + rules.md
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/*.tex
!docs/*.pdf
!docs/*.md

# data/ — only the two final datasets (raw asd/, allobench/ stay local)
!data/
data/*
!data/validation_data.csv
!data/training/
data/training/*
!data/training/allosteric_training.csv

# results/ — only the encoding artifacts (NOT the multi-MB PDB cache)
!results/
results/*
!results/encodings/
!results/encodings/**

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
